      "about_title": "About Logsim",
      "about_text": "GF2 Logic Simulator\nGraphical interface with circuit overview and oscilloscope.\nUnicode sample: Ω Ж 中",
      "help_text": "Run: cold-starts the circuit and records N cycles.\nContinue: records N more cycles without clearing traces.\nStep: advances by one cycle.\nAuto Run: keeps stepping until you stop it.\nSet Switch: changes the selected switch to 0 or 1.\nAdd/Remove Monitor: controls which outputs are shown.\nView: Maximise or Fit each panel; 3D Circuit and 3D Scopes switch between 2D and 3D.\nCircuit: the mouse wheel zooms at the cursor, Shift+wheel scrolls, and scrollbars move around large diagrams.\nOscilloscope: the wheel zooms signal rows, Shift+wheel zooms the time axis, and scrollbars move across rows and cycles.\n3D views: left-drag rotates, right-drag pans, the wheel zooms, and the corner axes show the orientation.\n3D Circuit: the wheel zooms at the cursor and the scrollbars pan the camera.\n3D Scopes: hover over a trace to see its signal name; Shift+wheel scrolls rows.\nSettings menu: language, dark mode, and colour-blind colours.\nFile menu: open or save definition files and export images.",
